  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal gas goes through a reversible cycle <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>d</mi></math> has the V - T diagram shown below. Process <math><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>c</mi></math> are adiabatic.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/feb64732-39cd-4e8b-b354-6accffa0ae44-image.png\" style=\"width: 257px; height: 183px;\" /><br /><br />The corresponding P - V diagram for the process is (all figures are schematic and not drawn to scale) :",
